# prompt: stone cracking hit
# tags: stone, crack, impact, rock
# The grain field is the fracture: stone does not ring, it sheds chips, and a
# scatter of short unbent pings (`bend 1`, the ice-and-ceramic end of the
# range) is what that sounds like.
sound "stone crack" 310ms impact
  crack: noise white >> bp ~2400Hz[1200..5000] Q2 >> dist drive ~3[1..8] mix 0.4 | gain 0.4 decay 60ms
  shards: grains ~1800Hz[800..4000] rate 90 width 6ms spread 2.5 bend 1 | gain 0.24 decay 260ms delay 20ms
  mass: modal wood ~150Hz[80..300] Q25 | gain 0.3 decay 220ms
